  {
    "kind": "practice",
    "title_fr": "Numéro togolais",
    "instruction_fr": "Écris normaliser_tel(texte) : retire les espaces ; si le résultat est 8 chiffres, éventuellement précédés de +228, renvoie \"+228\" suivi des 8 chiffres ; sinon renvoie None.",
    "starter_code": "def normaliser_tel(texte):\n    return \"+228\" + texte\n",
    "solution": "import re\n\ndef normaliser_tel(texte):\n    brut = texte.replace(\" \", \"\")\n    m = re.fullmatch(r\"(\\+228)?(\\d{8})\", brut)\n    if m is None:\n        return None\n    return \"+228\" + m.group(2)\n",
    "visible_tests": [
      {
        "inputs": [],
        "expected_output": "",
        "calls": [
          {
            "name": "normaliser_tel",
            "args": [
              "90 12 34 56"
            ],
            "unchanged_args": true,
            "expected": "+22890123456"
          },
          {
            "name": "normaliser_tel",
            "args": [
              "+228 70 11 22 33"
            ],
            "unchanged_args": true,
            "expected": "+22870112233"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hidden_tests": [
      {
        "inputs": [],
        "expected_output": "",
        "calls": [
          {
            "name": "normaliser_tel",
            "args": [
              "9012345"
            ],
            "unchanged_args": true,
            "expected": null
          },
          {
            "name": "normaliser_tel",
            "args": [
              "+229 90 12 34 56"
            ],
            "unchanged_args": true,
            "expected": null
          },
          {
            "name": "normaliser_tel",
            "args": [
              "90-12-34-56"
            ],
            "unchanged_args": true,
            "expected": null
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hints": [
      "Retire les espaces avec replace.",
      "(\\+228)? rend l’indicatif facultatif ; \\d{8} exige huit chiffres.",
      "m.group(2) renvoie les huit chiffres."
    ],
    "explanation_fr": "Normaliser donne un format unique, plus simple à comparer et à stocker.",
